4065|  *
4066|  *  Translate an instruction word into a ppc_instr_call. ic is filled in with
4067|  *  valid data for the translated instruction, or a "nothing" instruction if
4068|  *  there was a translation failure. The newly translated instruction is then
4069|  *  executed.
