**9.5 `regress/ppc_rldicl_probe.py` -- its disassembler cross-check rule (header), its session function (the `-C`
CPU override and the `unassemble` capture), and its 32-bit session inside a gated DETECTOR:**
~~~~
88|   disasm xcheck every instruction word placed is disassembled by the tree's own
89|                 disassembler (cpu_ppc.c, a DIFFERENT code path from the execute
90|                 handler in cpu_ppc_instr.c) and compared against the operands the
91|                 encoder intended.  Guards the hand-assembled-encoding trap.
92|                 [#565, 2026-10-18: NOT every word.  Only the control and census sessions'
93|                 196 words (6 + 190) are COMPARED.  The 32-bit (2), vacuity (2) and
