The row review found a significant gap: `ldu` and `stdu` each need an RA=0 refusal check at both zero and nonzero displacement. A missing update is invisible in a valid DS=0 access, but visible when it incorrectly allows an invalid form to execute. I also read R18 as requiring displacement-scope controls for all 22 D-form labels.
